  "configuration_id": "config_011",
  "reason": "The strongest RNA evidence so far is config_002, where multiprofile + avgpool with PCA substantially improves validation accuracy and F1 over singleprofile PCA and transformer aggregation. However, there is no image-only evidence yet, so it is unclear whether image features are useful or whether multimodal fusion should be pursued. config_011 tests image-only ResNet50 under the same multiprofile + avgpool setting that worked best for RNA, providing a clean baseline to compare against config_002 and later multimodal ResNet50 experiments. This is the best next use of budget because it reduces major uncertainty about the image modality before committing to more complex multimodal configurations."
}

